      "text": "\\end{equation}\nAn empty group is the unit mass at one.  A marked convolution already\ncontains its marked multiplicities.  Only its ordered residual slots\nare divided by their factorials: regrouping a signed atom\n$\\epsilon\\one_{\\mathrm{sf}}N_{\\mathrm{all}}/M_{\\mathrm{res}}$\ngives the external scalar $\\epsilon M_1M_2M_3/M_{\\mathrm{res}}$.\nThis scalar is fixed, although it need not be bounded by one.",
